# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:29
msgid ""
"OpenShot Video Editor has 3 main components, a Python & PyQt user interface "
"(:openshot-github:`openshot-qt`), a C++ audio library (:openshot-"
"github:`libopenshot-audio`) and a C++ video library (:openshot-"
"github:`libopenshot`). If you are not familiar with Python, PyQt, or C++, "
"those would be great topics to research and learn more about at this point."
